      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. It verifies that `Printer.Outline.addText()` throws `NullPointerException` from `Entities` when `OutputSettings` is null (because `Entities.escape` receives a null settings argument). Let me write an improved version.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version uses descriptive variable names (`cdataNode`, `output`, `appendable`, `outlinePrinter`) and adds a Javadoc comment explaining why the `NullPointerException` is expected, while preserving identical runtime behavior."
